test dimension  SECTION CODE  A H  axillary lymph nodes  D E F each one node bisected  I L  representative sections of firm  white area and adjacent deep margin  below vertical scar  from medial to lateral  M  representative section of firm  slightly gritty breast parenchyma  7 0cm from vertical scar  lateral N  representative section of firm  slightly gritty breast parenchyma  10 0cm lateral to linear scar  new discrete mass is formed by the firm breast parenchyma O  representative section of nipple  Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST and AXILLARY NODES   report_end  , Unchecked.
