 medial aspect is a stellate  soft  mottled yellow tan  il defined region about 2 5cm in greatest dimension  It extends to the margin of the specimen  Section Code  A E  medial cavity  representative sections  F  lateral cavity  closest approach to inked resection margin G J  lateral cavity  representative sections K  white  firm parenchymal streak  closest approach to inked resection margin L  white  firm parenchymal streak  representative section M  low axillary lymph nodes N O  distal axillary lymph nodes  R T  biopsy scar near medial margin U X  breast tissue Also received fresh  labeled  additional axillary tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan yellow  soft tissue fragment  bisected and submitted entirely in P  Resident  DARRYL E  PALMER TOY  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Benjamin Alan Spencer  M D  PART A  MASTECTOMY  LEFT  PART B  ADDITIONAL AXILLARY TISSUE   report_end  , Unchecked.
