beled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  secondary axillary sentinel node  120  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm lymph node which is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  tertiary axillary sentinel node  111  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm lymph node which is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in L and M  Resident  MASSIMO D APUZZO  MD PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL 973   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL 120   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLRY SENTINEL 111   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
