rgin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of unremarkable tan red fibrofatty tissue which is submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL MARGIN   EXCISION  report_end  , Unchecked.
