y a rim of intense fibrosis and semifirm sulphur yellow discoloration  The biopsy site is immediately subjacent to the epidermal scar  and approaches to within 0 9cm of the deep inked margin  1 5cm of the superior margin  1 5cm of the lateral margin  1 8cm of the inferior margin  and 5 8cm of the medial margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of mature  lobular  yellow  adipose tissue with thick interculating fibrous bands  The axillary tail is explored for lymph nodes  sixteen lymph nodes are identified  SECTION CODE  A D  biopsy site and deep inked margin  E  biopsy site and skin  F G  biopsy site and superior margin  H I  biopsy site and inferior margin  J K  biopsy site and lateral margin  L  medial margin  en face  M  biopsy site  N  nipple O S  lymph nodes  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT  , Unchecked.
