oration  This area is 0 3cm from the closest anterior margin  more than 1 0cm from the remaining margins  The remaining breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  The specimen is submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and its relationship to the closest inferior  anterior and posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and its relationship to the closest superior and posterior margin  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin of the specimen  enface   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Firm fibrous area next to the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section of the cavity from lateral to medial   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remaining tissue  Gross Dictation by Julia Turbiner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Julia Turbiner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
