e  A 4 x 2 5cm defect of the biopsy cavity is present at the deep margin  The anterior surface is inked black  the deep margin inked blue and the superior surface inked yellow  The breast is serially sectioned from lateral to medial to reveal a biopsy cavity with a indurated  partially fibrotic wall measuring 1cm in maximal thickness with multiple  discrete  pink  firm  gritty foci grossly abutting the anterior  deep  and medial deep margins  Areas of fat necrosis and fibrosis are present focally in the wall of the biopsy cavity  SECTION CODE A  Lateral margin  en face  B  Medial margin  en face  C D  Representative sections of discrete  pink  gritty areas in relation to anterior margin  inked in black   E  Representative section of gritty  pink lesions in relation to the medial deep margin  F J  Representative sections of biopsy cavity from lateral to medial  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final superior deep right breast tissue  is a 10 x 5 x 2cm piece of breast with a short black stitch designating superior margin and a long black stitch designating the deep margin  The anterior surface is inked black  the superior surface yellow  and the deep margin in inked blue  A discrete REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm pink  gritty area is present less than 0 1cm of the anterior margin in the more superior aspect of the breast re excision  The remainder of the tissue is composed of adipose tissue in the more inferior deep aspect of the specimen with more fibrous breast parenchyma in the superior aspect of the tissue marked with a short stitch  SECTION CODE K  Discrete gritty area in relation to the anterior margin  L T  Representative sections of breast from inferior to superior  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREA