 located 9 0cm from the superior border and 15 0cm from the lateral border  The epidermal surface is notable for a 3 0cm long  healing  diagonal scar located in the upper outer quadrant  6 5cm from the nipple  2 5cm from the superior skin margin  and 3 0cm from the lateral skin margin  The skin surrounding the healing incision is ecchymotic  and yellow purple  with a raised  irregular  firm  REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm area  The deep resection margin is a smooth plane  The specimen is inked entirely in black  and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm biopsy cavity that is distended by dark red brown  firm  gelatinous material  and is surrounded by an irregular rim of firm  tan yellow tissue  The biopsy site is located 0 3cm subadjacent to the skin  1 5cm from the inked superior soft tissue resection margin  2 5cm from the deep soft tissue resection margin  6 0cm from the medial soft tissue resection margin  12 0cm from the inferior soft tissue resection margin  and 8 0cm from the lateral soft tissue resection margin  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm irregular  somewhat well delineated  diffuse sheet of tan pink  firm  focally gritty tissue is located 2 5cm from the deep soft tissue resection margin  1 0cm from the inferior margin  11 0cm from the superior margin  6 0cm from the lateral margin  and 6 0cm from the medial margin  In addition  several REMOVED_DATE to 0 5cm  round tan to white  rubbery areas that protrude from the surrounding breast parenchyma are identified throughout the specimen  The remaining breast is composed of yellow  lobulated  soft adipose tissue with intercalating  thin  tan pink  shiny  fibrous bands  The axillary tail is dissected to reveal multiple  19  lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  The cut surface is variable tan pink and fleshy to white  Section Code  A  nipple  B  skin with scar and biopsy cavity  C  deep resection margin with biopsy cavity  