re bisected to reveal tan pink to fleshy cut surfaces  Section Code  V  nipple  W  skin  X  deep resection margin adjacent to upper outer quadrant fibrous area  radial section  Y Z  fibrous area  upper outer quadrant  representative sections  AA  deep resection margin adjacent to lower outer quadrant fibrous area  radial section  BB CC  lower outer quadrant  fibrous area  representative sections  DD EE  upper inner quadrant  representative sections  FF GG  lower inner quadrant  representative sections  HH KK  lymph nodes  Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST AND AXILLARY NODES PART B  LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
