al resection margin  0 3cm from the inferior resection margin  0 6cm from the superior resection margin  1 9cm from the lateral resection margin and 1 6cm from the skin  A 0 5cm in greatest dimension  ill defined tan lesion is present just lateral to the cavity  Section Code  A  frozen section  1  B  medial resection margin  en face  C  cavity in relation to the superior resection margin  D  cavity in relation to the inferior resection margin  E  lateral resection margin en face  F    lesion  G M  90  of the cavity  N  the cavity in relation to the skin  O S  rest of the breast tissue  Also received fresh labeled  Left axilla nodes  is a 7 x 6 x 1cm piece of adipose tissue in which are found tan brown rubbery lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 5cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  entirely submitted in T through Y  Resident  Essam Ahmed  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS      LEFT  BREAST  1  RESIDUAL INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  2  FAT NECROSIS  3  THE INKED MARGIN IS FREE OF TUMOR  O R  Resident  C  Diana Jordan  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   AXILLA NODE  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
