ack red blood  which is 4 0cm lateral to the nipple and comes to 1 3cm of the posterior margin and 5 5cm of the skin  Other margins are away from the cavity  Also identified is a separate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm tan white stellate firm area  which is 6 8cm deep to the nipple and comes to 1 5cm of the deep margin and 2 1cm of the inferior margin  The remaining parenchyma is predominantly fatty with scattered areas of tan white rubbery tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows  C D  the cavity related to the deep margin E G  additional representative sections of the cavity H I  the stellate firm area related to the deep margin J  the stellate firm area related to the inferior margin K  tan white rubbery parenchyma  Resident  Mari Mino  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  Annekathryn Goodman  M D  PART A  ENDOCERVIX  CURETTAGE PART B  ENDOMETRIUM  CURETTAGE PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
