or margin  No other lesions are noted  The axilla is dissected and 19 nodes are identified with the largest measuring REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  SECTION CODE  A D  Representative sections of biopsy cavity from lateral to medial  E  Inferior quadrant parenchyma  lateral  F  Parenchyma  medial  G  Representative section of scar from superior lateral  H  Representative section of nipple adjacent to cavity  I  3 axillary lymph nodes  J  2 axillary lymph nodes  K  1 axillary lymph node  L  5 axillary lymph nodes  M  3 axillary lymph nodes  N  3 axillary lymph nodes  Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
