 tan nodular area  1cm from the deep resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is mostly composed of unremarkable adipose tissue  except for focal white fibrous areas which contain occasional cysts  the largest less than 0 4cm  A 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm irregular stellate  white firm area is present at the proximal axillary tail  The axillary nodes range is size from REMOVED_DATE to 1cm in largest dimension and they are grossly unremarkable  SECTION CODE  A D  entire irregular area beneath the healing incision  including overlying skin E  deep margin F  nipple G  scarred area at the other end H J  representative breast parenchyma from firmer areas K O  irregular firmer area at the proximal axillary tail and representative halves of the dissected axillary lymph nodes Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  AMBULATORY GEN SURGICAL   ACC 4 REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART   LEFT BREAST AXILLA   report_end  , Unchecked.
